      "index": 0,
      "key": "evidence_quote",
      "quote": "The U.S. Department of the Treasury released Treasury International Capital (TIC) data for December 2011 on February 15, 2012. Foreign residents decreased their holdings of long-term U.S. securities in December, with net sales of $21.0 billion. Private foreign investors sold $11.5 billion, while foreign official institutions sold $9.5 billion. U.S.",
